1. Online Cart System

Class Item:
    Attributes:
        name
        price

Class Cart:
    Attribute:
        List<Item> items

    Method addItem(item):
        Add item to items list

    Generic Method calculateTotalPrice(List<T> itemList):
        total = 0
        For each item in itemList:
            total += item.price
        Return total

2. Hospital Department Mapper

Class Doctor:
    Attributes:
        name
        specialization

Initialize Map<String, List<Doctor>> departmentMap

Function addDoctorToDepartment(department, doctor):
    If department not in departmentMap:
        Create new list and add doctor
        Put department -> list in map
    Else:
        Add doctor to existing list

Function filterDoctorsBySpecialization(specialization):
    Initialize List<Doctor> filteredDoctors
    For each department in departmentMap:
        For each doctor in departmentMap[department]:
            If doctor.specialization == specialization:
                Add doctor to filteredDoctors
    Return filteredDoctors
